mory entry is our third case.","startMs":34580,"endMs":37540},{"text":"Untrusted content becomes reusable guidance and may influence later","startMs":37540,"endMs":41460},{"text":"runs after its original source is no longer visible.","startMs":41460,"endMs":45200},{"text":"These scenarios illustrate attack mechanisms; the named company and","startMs":45200,"endMs":49080},{"text":"incident are not documented production evidence.","startMs":49080,"endMs":51620},{"text":"Their common failure is allowing data or model proposals","startMs":51620,"endMs":55360},{"text":"to cross a boundary between evidence and permission without","startMs":55360,"endMs":58360},{"text":"adequate enforcement.","startMs":58360,"endMs":60380},{"text":"Our governing question is: what can a redirected model","startMs":60380,"endMs":63460},{"text":"actually reach?","startMs":63460,"endMs":65300},{"text":"We will map data flows, apply task permissions through","startMs":65300,"endMs":68160},{"text":"trusted components outside the prompt, inspect tool and memory","startMs":68160,"endMs":71860},{"text":"trust, constrain stale actions, and test recovery.","startMs":71860,"endMs":75000},{"text":"By the end, you should be able to explain","startMs":75000,"endMs":77920},{"text":"what each control prevents, what it only detects, and","startMs":77920,"endMs":81200},{"text":"what uncertainty remains.","startMs":81200,"endMs":82320}],"boardEvents":[{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":0},{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":1},{"atMs":18600,"actionIndex":2},{"atMs":24560,"actionIndex":3},{"atMs":34580,"actionIndex":4},{"atMs":60380,"actionIndex":5}],"boardTimingMethod":"authored-spoken-cues-v1"}